{"unit_id":"2026heshao__dsh-forget-session#card-zh","repo":"2026heshao/dsh-forget-session","commit":"64796c9b1423972ae54d2cfa230acc6c4d546c0e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-forget-session 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话清理插件，在侧栏会话菜单加入两段式确认的「遗忘会话」操作。确认后通过 Host 远端服务停止会话工作，摘除活体和工作区、归档及置顶状态，并删除会话日志与投影缓存；客户端同步移除会话行并显示结果提示。适合需要从 DSH 清理单个会话及其本地记录的用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:147-220","lib/index.js:282-370"]}
{"unit_id":"2026heshao__dsh-forget-session#card-en","repo":"2026heshao/dsh-forget-session","commit":"64796c9b1423972ae54d2cfa230acc6c4d546c0e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-forget-session adds a confirmed delete action to the DSH Web session menu. It stops work, detaches session state, clears archive and pin status, and deletes logs and projection cache. The client removes the sidebar row and shows a toast. Use it to remove a session and its local records.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:147-220","lib/index.js:282-370"]}
